#X text 2900 720 The tempo is a part of the playing section \, tempo (ref/module/songs.md): every BPM the bus carries is put with the section policy \, and a section's restore of it comes in as the phone's tempo does \, so it reaches the bus whole and within 5 to 1000 \, holds knob 1 there and is put straight back \, or under the 500 BPM repeat \, becomes the tempo it goes back to. A restore of the tempo already in force is dropped by the spigot: it would change nothing but hold knob 1 where it may stand live., f 36;
