#X text 3300 650 The 500 BPM repeat's tempo is a flourish: while pad-35 is held the Lua shuts this spigot \, so nothing the bus carries is put in the section (ref/module/tempo.md). It sends the tempo to go back to first \, and opens it after \, so nothing is put then either. The BPM to go back to comes with fast 1 \, from the f beside the route \, so the Lua is not called for every BPM of a sweep of knob 1., f 40;
